// A blank unicode line does not hide the suggestion. The next line is the line.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE lead ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE law  ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG lead law

IMPULSE lead 1
IMPULSE law 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY law
DECIDE law
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "lead" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
